します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-sRFXTns0g-3cptun1t26SM6WuEqV5xV", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k0banzame_omo/works/115", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87edfe20/uploads/origins/e2f3828d-da64-4564-9eb5-84e32b8c82e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01231023354853705e38464255b964d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87edfe20/uploads/origins/e2f3828d-da64-4564-9eb5-84e32b8c82e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01231023354853705e38464255b964d9, https://si.imgix.net/87edfe20/uploads/origins/e2f3828d-da64-4564-9eb5-84e32b8c82e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e43d82509a80e6eeef47b224fac08a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/87edfe20/uploads/origins/e2f3828d-da64-4564-9eb5-84e32b8c82e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db5895c6da2f79b7a448e4e26a351316 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生こんにちは！\n気軽に描いてください、よろしくお願いします (_ _ )\n\n【キャラクター設定】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15tbFZ6u8wQSSqjtoekEZFe5Tmm108NlQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@k0banzame_omo/works/114", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a485b9bc/uploads/origins/fd2efa6c-b4a7-4d2f-aaef-f3e350b49243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56523f04624fc2e207a00d319390c5f5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a485b9bc/uploads/origins/fd2efa6c-b4a7-4d2f-aaef-f3e350b49243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56523f04624fc2e207a00d319390c5f5, https://si.imgix.net/a485b9bc/uploads/origins/fd2efa6c-b4a7-4d2f-aaef-f3e350b49243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc742cfc86d6eb5d24a4c57155e62788 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a485b9bc/uploads/origins/fd2efa6c-b4a7-4d2f-aaef-f3e350b49243?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=